+ * GalaxyCore GC02M1B monochrome image sensor driver
+ *
+ * Register settings come from the OnePlus 9 Pro mono camera module data
+ * (com.qti.sensormodule.lemonadep.holitech_gc02m1b.bin): 1600x1200 at
+ * 30 fps over one MIPI D-PHY lane at 672 Mbps.
+ */
